  "title": "Dad&#39;s Pumpkin Chiffon Pie",
  "description": "Deliciously different pumpkin chiffon pie with a gingersnap crust! My family has used this pumpkin pie recipe exclusively for all the 43 years I have been around! Originally submitted to ThanksgivingRecipe.com.",
  "authors": [
    "Jennifer Powell"
  ],
